:: Dad Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
Thinking for a second about where to go, you ask <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> if the park sounds fun and he nods. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sure thing, sport.”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">He says with a smile as he ruffles your hair,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Come on.”</span> <span style="color:Pink"> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span>, rather embarrassingly, holds your hand as you walk towards the park.</span> You blush a little, though try not to focus on it as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Dad</span> chats with you along the way. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You know, the park was pretty different when I was younger. I remember when they first put that pond in. I mean, it was already kind of a pond, but was overgrown and would only really be full when it rained. I think it was middle school that they took the time to make it all fancy.”</span> He laughs as he reminisces.<br>

