<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask if his dad ever took him to the park when he was little<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask if his dad ever took him and his brothers to the park like this. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Your grandfather taking us to the park?”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> responds with a laugh, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Nah, he wasn’t really the type. To be fair, he worked all the time and wasn’t really into the whole <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“playing with his kids”</span> thing. It was a different time back then; he practically worked non-stop up until his clock ran out.”</span> <span style="color:Yellow">You feel a bit bad for asking, though <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Your Father</span> doesn’t seem too bothered by the question.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Mom would take us sometimes, though. But she would mostly sit around and read or paint, if it was the weekend. Mainly just be me and my brothers, and I’m sure you could guess how much fun that was.”</span> He laughs again, giving you a knowing look.<br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Dad Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "Ask how much things have changed<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You ask just how much things has changed since he was a kid. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Well, I graduated school like two decades ago, but we still lived here until you were a little over a year old. But even in that time, this place feels so different, but also like nothing has changed. It’s kind of hard to explain.”</span> He laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But when I was Noah’s age, it was super different. Half the city didn’t even exist back then and the place where we live now was all forest.”</span> You nod along as he talks about the past. <span style="color:LightGreen">It’s hard to imagine seeing Opal City grow so much in just a few decades.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Dad Hang Out Park]]
